{"book":9,"chapter":5,"context":{"chapter":5,"title":"Dagon Falls Before the Ark","summary":"The Philistines place the captured ark in the temple of their god Dagon at Ashdod. Dagon's statue falls on its face before the ark, then is found broken. Plague strikes Ashdod, Gath and Ekron, and each city wants the ark gone.","background":"Conquerors often placed captured images of a defeated people's god in their own temple as a trophy. Ashdod, Gath and Ekron were three of the five main Philistine cities. 'Emerods' were painful swellings or tumors; because the Philistines later send golden mice (6:4-5), many think this was a plague spread by rodents.","customs":[{"term":"Tread on the threshold","verses":"5:5","note":"Dagon's priests avoided stepping on the threshold where the broken statue had lain, a custom still kept 'unto this day.'"}],"watchFor":["Dagon first bows before the ark (v. 3), then is shattered (v. 4).","'The hand of the Lord was heavy' (vv. 6, 9, 11).","The cities pass the ark along like a hot coal (vv. 8–10)."],"connections":["Exodus 12:12","Judges 16:23","Isaiah 46:1-2","Zephaniah 1:9"]},"verses":{"1":{"w":[["וּפְלִשְׁתִּים","ufelishtim","H6430","HC/Ngmpa","and [the] Philistines"],["לָקְחוּ","lakechu","H3947","HVqp3cp","they took"],["אֵת","'et","H853","HTo","<obj.>"],["אֲרוֹן","'aron","H727","HNcmsc","[the] ark of"],["הָאֱלֹהִים","ha'elohim","H430","HTd/Ncmpa","<the> God"],["וַיְבִאֻהוּ","vayvi'uhu","H935","Hc/Vhw3mp/Sp3ms","and they brought it"],["מֵאֶבֶן","me'even","H72","HR/Npl","from Eben-"],["הָעֵזֶר","ha'ezer","H72","HTd/Npl","<the> -ezer"],["אַשְׁדּוֹדָה","'ashdodah","H795","HNpl/Sd","Ashdod towards"]],"x":[[9007012,9007012,5],[9004001,9004001,4],[6013003,6013003,3],[9004022,9004022,3]],"xn":4},"2":{"w":[["וַיִּקְחוּ","vaiyikchu","H3947","Hc/Vqw3mp","and they took"],["פְלִשְׁתִּים","felishtim","H6430","HNgmpa","[the] Philistines"],["אֶת","'et-","H853","HTo","<obj.>"],["אֲרוֹן","'aron","H727","HNcmsc","[the] ark of"],["הָאֱלֹהִים","ha'elohim","H430"